{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01V4:prose-0003", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "risk_level": "R2", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following lemma characterizes a smooth morphism as a\nflat, finitely presented morphism with smooth fibres.\nNote that schemes smooth over a field are discussed in more detail in\nVarieties, Section <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "REF_0001": "\\ref{varieties-section-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:d16fbd499e9d792e1d2b5bf57a3758e0bda48bf4016c15160808c71bccb4c4fa", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:48e8655d8337365f6805fed8443c1b9ee3d521e0e751c31592f29c0320b099aa", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01V8:statement", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nIf <MATH_0002> is flat, locally of finite presentation, and all\nfibres <MATH_0003> are smooth, then <MATH_0004>\nis smooth.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$X_s$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-smooth-flat-smooth-fibres}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:e7ec64c39ff1a115fc3aef326289387366fe923f36240c9131065e9ec0582f8f", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f18a7159c8038c312f675af8dc71dde1ad75b513f4b27c8e42606c4233fa5d41", "source_math_hash": "sha256:122982a8547a7ebeef5c74ca65bdbb4ff53e3196708cab4a95f4bdc38eb25749"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01V8:proof", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Follows from Algebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-fibre-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:761032c599bbc430e31bca88c1fdc5e5b538ee42332c533fb0efb494881d90a2", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:afba05bbb30a8ef2951b3e2fd9ea2105158ed0a1a7465a62813b7cc9308b1f8a", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01VA:statement", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "The composition of two morphisms which are smooth is smooth.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-smooth}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:49d85593f66da3b7dc73cd5b85395d82736db1ee711f738f4ae335c9647f287f", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:55c26622701b9fc5544efca06c66a131d8452a8054f65db4c38a75fb967461fb", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01VA:proof", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "In the proof of Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe saw that being smooth is a local property of ring maps.\nHence the first statement of the lemma follows from\nLemma <REF_0002> combined\nwith the fact that being smooth is a property of ring maps that is\nstable under composition, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-smooth-characterize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-composition-type-P}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-compose-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:fe63c53fd2153882c269acf49e50f4ffebfd2da50d411ad76504e12019bf2772", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:485959cb812110ecbf60c35ec6cb2c013cb2f2c5443f03b88027d5e1f83b5532", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01VB:statement", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "The base change of a morphism which is smooth is smooth.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-smooth}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:5ccdb6a81ad7c0bb1ddcd842102be59c8455721ea6daf84d37c2b496d041b451", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6f7ba848fb361e28f80fe3c9a60c9abf1ce6fade7d6d519a156c678f032ab8db", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:01VB:proof", "parent_tag": "01V4", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "In the proof of Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe saw that being smooth is a local property of ring maps.\nHence the lemma follows from\nLemma <REF_0002> combined\nwith the fact that being smooth is a property of ring maps that is\nstable under base change, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-smooth-characterize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-composition-type-P}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-base-change-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:81dc06a119c109671171b303d100fc5baf6b61be3e0ca201791bd7b84db4b075", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2847c800c768718570de29379a03f9e2698113b8df30fedd843315b80f0d392c", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
